# ScanLogic Business Suite — Core

## Product

- **ScanLogic Business Suite**: mobile-first PWA (`vite-plugin-pwa`) with tabs Docs, Tax Vault, DocDraft, Contracts, Lawyer AI, Settings.
- **ScanVault**: separate mode (`App.jsx` → `ScanVaultRoot`) for focused scanning; opened from Settings or `?share=` links.
- **BizStart Germany**: nested inside Tax Vault (`TaxVaultHome` → `BizStartGermany`), not a top-level tab.

## Stack

- React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind 4 + React Router (minimal — tab state in `Dashboard.jsx`).
- Path alias: `@/` → `src/`.
- Data: `src/lib/appApi.js` (entities + LLM + file upload). Persistence: `localStorage` or Supabase via `/api/db` when `DATABASE_URL` is set.
- AI: `src/lib/anthropic.js` → `/api/llm` proxy (`server/llm-proxy.mjs`). Never put API keys in `VITE_*`.

## Key files

| Area | Entry |
|------|--------|
| App shell | `src/App.jsx`, `src/pages/Dashboard.jsx`, `src/components/layout/AppShell.jsx` |
| Data layer | `src/lib/appApi.js`, `src/lib/schemas.js` |
| Guide copy | `src/lib/guide/appModules.js` |
